{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46655","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭石 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见庭石，岂知经夏眠。\n不能资药价，空自作苔钱。\n翠忆蓝光底，青思瀑影边。\n岩僧应笑我，细碎种阶前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}